B.GN=new A.ac("notepad","Butler's Notepad","dining",0,"Graham's household notepad. The top sheet is gone, but the rubbing raises what was written on it: \u201c10:30, chess with the Colonel. He cheats.\u201d An appointment, and by all accounts he kept it.",B.jq,B.a0,null,B.fK,B.K0,null)
